    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Am-on",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Am-on cu Kuoth Nhial mɛmɛ lar wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duundɛ ɣöö kɛ kɔrɛ bä ji̱ Am-on nyɔk kɛ loc ni guäthdiɛn, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Ɛ-dɔm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua mɛmɛ lar kɛ kui̱ Ɛ-dɔm ɛ Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Mi ci nɛy tin /ca dee duäc riɛk jek, deri lɛ wä a /ka̱n duäc? /Ci dee met wä ɛ /ka̱n duäc, ba ji̱ yi̱k duäc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ruac ɛn ɣöö cɛ rɔ yac nikɛ ciötdɛ kɛ ɣöö bɛ Bɔ-dhɛ-ra jak kä mi jiääk, kä ba cäät kä mi ca lam. Kä bi wi̱i̱kɛ diaal te ni baaŋ a ci da̱k.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bi Ɛ-dɔm jiääk ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä ram mi wä rët kɛ jɛ, bɛ dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä bɛ ga̱a̱c kɛ kui̱ däkädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tkɛ mëë ca Thɔ-dɔm kɛnɛ Go-mo-ra kɛ wi̱i̱ ji̱ thieekädiɛn diaal däk. Thilɛ ram mi bi cieŋ ɛn wani, kä thilɛ ram mi bi jɛ nyɔk kɛ rët. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ɣän bäkɛ jak kä bar kɛ rɔ̱ kä Ɛ-dɔm kɛ Pɛ̈th ce̱tnikɛ lony mi ri̱i̱ŋ raar rɛy ruɔ̱ɔ̱p Jɔr-dɛn, mi ban tɔ̱ɔ̱r la̱k deet, ɣän bäkɛ jakä bar kɛ rɔ̱ ni kä kɛɛl kä jɛ. Kä bä ram mi bi jɛ ruac kuany ce̱tnikɛ min göörä. Kɛ ɣöö ɛŋa mi ce̱tkɛ ɣä? Kä ɛŋa ɛnɔ bi ɣä cɔl? Kä ɛ yieen deet in mith bi cuɔ̱ŋ nhiamdä mɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ liɛŋɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar kɛ kui̱ Ɛ-dɔm kɛnɛ tin bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c tin cɛ rialikä kɛ kui̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n ji̱ Te-man mëë caarɛ ɣöö ɛ puc cäŋɛ ni gaatkiɛn tin tɔ̱a̱tni, ba kɛ naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. Ɛ puc, ba gaatkiɛn moc dual mi di̱i̱t kä bakɛ naŋ pɛɛcä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ lieŋ pɛɛnädiɛn bɛ piny lath. Kä ba jɔw wi̱i̱kädiɛn liŋ ni Bar in Tith (Bar Gutdä). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, bi gua̱n tɛ̈r ri̱i̱ŋ kɛ pɛ̈th ce̱tnikɛ cuɔɔr mi ɣäär gɔ̱kɛ wi̱i̱ Bɔ-dhɛ-ra, ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi lo̱c ji̱ Ɛ-dɔm cu baath ce̱tkɛ lɔc ciëk mi tekɛ mäc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Da-math-kɛth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Ke-dhar kɛnɛ Ɣa-dhor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ Ke-dhar kɛnɛ kua̱r Ɣa-dhor tëë ci kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kɛ däk,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Ee-lam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu mɛmɛ a ruac Kuoth Nhial ëë ci ben kä gök ni Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ kui̱ Ee-lam, kɛ tuk ruecä kua̱r Juda ni Dhid-ki-yaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa mɛmɛ lar wëë i̱, “Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän bä bäär ji̱ Ee-lam to̱l, gua̱a̱th in te buɔ̱mdiɛn kɛɛliw thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän bä jiɔam da̱ŋ ŋuaan nööŋ pëkni nhial da̱ŋ ŋuaan. Kä bä kɛ riaw rɛy jiɔamni diaal, kä bɛ thil do̱r mi bi kään a thil raan kä nɛy tin ca juɔc raar kä Ee-lam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän bä Ee-lam moc kɛ dual nhiam ji̱ tɛ̈rɛ kɛnɛ nhiam nɛɛni tin görkɛ tëkdiɛn. Bä kɛ nöŋ mi jiääk, kɛ kui̱ gaakdä min di̱i̱t kɛ kɛ. Ɣän bäkɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ ko̱r gua̱thni diaal tɔ̱ bikɛ wä thi̱n tɔ̱ amäni ɣöö cäkɛ thuk ni kɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän bä kɔm kuäärädä la̱th kä Ee-lam. Kä bä kua̱rkiɛn kɛnɛ ruëëckiɛn dup.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
